      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know how stable dexdump is. I was thinking that we could add an option to dexdump to just list the classes in it but that seemed a little unnecessary.\n\n\u003e This will prevent the check from erroneously succeeding in case the dexdump output changes and it greps nothing.\n\nIt already fails if it doesn\u0027t find anything. It keeps a count of matches and if the count is 0 at the end then it fails. It will also fail if any line does not match.",
